# ---- HOST-NATIVE STATION (de-bridged 2026-08-12, conversion campaign) ----
# MAME 0.289's zx81 runs ON THE HOST: drawshm frames, ctlsock keys through
# the generated keymap. The ZX81 has no sound hardware — MAME's mixer still
# produces a (silent) stream, and the FIFO carries it so the station's
# audio:true identity is unchanged. Launcher: shared
# stations/mame-native/x11-runtime.sh; reset = relaunch restoring the golden.
SH_RESET_MODE=relaunch
SH_FIXTURE_DESC=Sinclair ZX81 (1981) at its own untouched power-on screen: a white field with a single inverse-video K in the bottom-left corner and nothing else — no banner, no memory count, no copyright line. K is the machine telling you it is in keyword mode, where one keypress enters a whole BASIC word (P gives PRINT). MAME 0.289 zx81 with -bios 2nd and -ramsize 1K running HOST-NATIVE (drawshm), drawn with aspect correction on the published 1024x768 surface — exactly the 4:3 of the television the machine was sold to be plugged into. Keyboard-only exhibit; no pointer device; the ZX81 has no sound hardware, so the stream is silent by design.
MAME_NATIVE_BIN=/data/vms/streamhost/assets/zx81/mame-native/zx81
MAME_NATIVE_DRIVER=zx81
MAME_NATIVE_ROMS=/data/vms/streamhost/assets/zx81/mame-native/roms
MAME_NATIVE_GEOM=1024x768
MAME_NATIVE_ARGS=-bios 2nd -ramsize 1K
# The bbcb/zx81/kc85_4/spectrum drivers have NO MACHINE_SUPPORTS_SAVE, so
# checkpoint restore is OFF (it restored garbage — 2026-08-12); reset is
# the cold boot, which reaches this scene in seconds.
MAME_NATIVE_CHECKPOINT=0
# SCANNED-MATRIX KEYBOARD: the guest's own ROM scans this matrix, so two
# keys down at once are ambiguous (ghosting/interleave) and the browser
# sends a typed line as ONE BURST — the daemon's SH_KEY_MIN_* gate paces
# only the QEMU/dbus path, never this one. Exclusive-scan restores the
# serialized delivery every station's pacing was bisected under (the same
# contract typeDemoProgram and validate_demo_pacing assume). Modifier
# fields (Shift/Ctrl) are exempt by name, so chords still work.
MAME_CTL_KEY_EXCL=:ROW
SH_MAMECTL_SOCK=/data/vms/streamhost/stations/zx81/ctl.sock
SH_MAMESOCK_KEYMAP=/data/vms/streamhost/stations/zx81/zx81.keymap
SH_AUDIO_SOURCE=fifo
SH_AUDIO_FIFO=/data/vms/streamhost/stations/zx81/audio.fifo

# ---- KEYBOARD PACING (the exhibit's only input surface) ----
# 100/100 shipped on the bridge tile — the ZX81 halts the CPU to draw and
# scans its matrix more slowly than the other 8-bits.
SH_KEY_MIN_HOLD_MS=100
SH_KEY_MIN_GAP_MS=100
